-# LK constant: alpha = 2 pi^2 k_B m_e / (hbar e)  [T/K], m* in units of m_e
-ALPHA = 2 * np.pi**2 * 1.380649e-23 * fb.ME / (fb.HBAR * fb.E)  # ~14.69
